{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年38歲的前TVB「咪神」白雲（Snowy）自2021年與建築師前夫離婚後，自結束5年婚姻後終於迎來第二春！上月初她高調認愛，公開與年僅22歲的德國籍機師相戀，這段相差16年的異國姊弟戀越戀越高調。雖然名花有主，但白雲並沒有吝嗇其好身材，日前再度大派福利！</p><figure><img alt=\"白雲擁有驕人身材。（IG/@snowybai）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201581528216506368418267.jpeg/RDBYUpGsCtFE2Sh2ZEuoDouh9u1YxqjLJv4Nyyb-Dcs\"/><figcaption>白雲擁有驕人身材。（IG/@snowybai）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"白雲戀上22歲外籍小鮮肉。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201581525276168192403217.jpeg/9xhiT20ON6diRzauHEFiOmmThGsWHJSa2O4LYNjuC2A\"/><figcaption>白雲戀上22歲外籍小鮮肉。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"狂放閃！（IG/@snowybai）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201581522331635712725089.jpeg/ntO4UcGuhb-vMpr1LOukHnlVRl_JftWErZW6pq2VuqY\"/><figcaption>狂放閃！（IG/@snowybai）</figcaption></figure><p>日前白雲在IG曬出一輯在拳館拍攝的噴血寫真，相中白雲戴上專業拳套站在擂台邊，身穿超性感白色內衣，超低胸剪裁未能遮掩其驕人上圍，將其噴血身材表露無遺。而下身的極幼帶三角褲設計超高衩，邊緣若隱若現極牙煙。德國籍機師更忍不住留言表示：「I miss and love u so much」。</p><figure><img alt=\"雖然名花有主，但白雲並沒有吝嗇其好身材。（IG/@snowybai）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201589463789080576089536.jpeg/mwvwZ98eqHTBbAs8EuZRI1H3kYObe0LoKcYyOynGMjs\"/><figcaption>雖然名花有主，但白雲並沒有吝嗇其好身材。（IG/@snowybai）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"日前白雲在IG曬出一輯在拳館拍攝的噴血寫真。（IG/@snowybai）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201589475135197184765924.jpeg/8R-yoEBCDkRdi4YSmdqS33T3c52jUpbPGFsBVRhbAVU\"/><figcaption>日前白雲在IG曬出一輯在拳館拍攝的噴血寫真。（IG/@snowybai）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"下身的極幼帶三角褲設計超高衩，邊緣若隱若現極牙煙。（IG/@snowybai）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201589472526209024013675.jpeg/2f57lIkZfzykpqgBIEfHLlyIeHDsUKMhcN8gdnDfIHY\"/><figcaption>下身的極幼帶三角褲設計超高衩，邊緣若隱若現極牙煙。（IG/@snowybai）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"白雲身材驕人！（IG/@snowybai）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201589469883666432840967.jpeg/36k_r9tIf93IScKuR7nGxHjxV1yyd7TIrIVA_ayFQP0\"/><figcaption>白雲身材驕人！（IG/@snowybai）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好性感！（IG/@snowybai）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201589467232735232709581.jpeg/7w5Rtambuai9FAQUjUyaM5RJpgMbvtS6qPnTl6j505c\"/><figcaption>好性感！（IG/@snowybai）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"難怪外籍男友都有留言表示：「I miss and love u so much」。（IG/@snowybai）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201589464485335040138267.jpeg/nXuygIMN1Gnl246vFBhsV-v9KVTrnMdXBAitHwQIrR8\"/><figcaption>難怪外籍男友都有留言表示：「I miss and love u so much」。（IG/@snowybai）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T11:43:51.728077+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":538,"images":9,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T11:30:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T13:08:20.182101+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T11:37:18.636604+00:00","content_hash":"c97aeea7dcf4ce756bcd60df3ab88021c705cb479b6ae8fb5ee6d1ed68b654fa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}